PROJECT PublicCatalog

MODEL Category
    name STRING UNIQUE

MODEL Item
    title STRING
    price FLOAT
    in_stock BOOLEAN

RELATION Category HAS_MANY Item

VALIDATE price MIN 0

ROUTE GET /categories
ROUTE POST /categories
ROUTE DELETE /categories/{id}
ROUTE GET /categories/{id}/items
ROUTE POST /items
ROUTE GET /items/{id}
ROUTE PATCH /items/{id}
ROUTE DELETE /items/{id}
